#AREA VanEttan Lake~
#AUTHORS Fudge~
#RANGES 60 95 0 99

#HELPS
-1 VANETTAN_CHANGES~
12.27.04 - 22 Spelling corrections. (Mag)
12.27.04 - In hermit equip quest the hermit uses qbits 0,5.  In the final
           fight he looks at qbits 0,3 to determine whether to load the equip.
           I changed it to the correct bits.  The quest is now fixed. (Mag)
12.27.04 - Made some grammar changes mainly to help readability.  Reformatted
           some says to improve flow of conversation. (Mag)
12.27.04 - Under certain circumstances Ssab would repop and create 2 Ssabs in
           the room.  Changed resets to only allow 1. (Mag)
12.28.04 - Modified Ssab's greet_prog to change depending on your quest
           status. (Mag)
~
0 $~



#MOBILES

@updated says to correct for spelling, grammar and add some flavor  12/18/03
#15800
hermit man old~
Old Hermit~
An old hermit sits here looking out the window.~
This man is one angry SOB, he doesn't like people barging into his home.
~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_DETECT_INVIS
0 S
95 BODY_TORSO|BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HEAD BODY_FOOT|BODY_HAND 20d20+16000 6d6+190
10 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>fight_prog 100~
if rand(75)
 c 'lightning bolt' $n
else
 if rand(50) 
  c 'acid blast' $n
 else
  if rand(50)
   c 'gas breath' $n
  endif
 endif
endif
~
>greet_prog 100~
if quest (0,5,$n)==0
 say Hello $n, can you help me with a small errand?
 say You will be rewarded for it.
else
 if quest (0,5,$n)==2 
  say Have you found a residence pass yet? 
 endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (0,5,$n)==0
 say Good, I need a residence pass.
 say I believe Steve either has one or knows where to get one.
 say I will reward you when I get me one.
 mpmset $n quest 0 5 1
else
  if quest (0,5,$n)==2
   say Good, let me have it please.
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog i15819~
if quest (0,5,$n)==2
 @mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
 mpmset $n quest 0 5 3
 say Thank you, but I am going to have to kill you now.
 say No one can know my true plan!
 say Goodbye!
 mpjunk i15819
 mpkill $n
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest (0,5,$n)==3
 mpmset $n quest 0 5 4
 mpoload 15800
 mpoload 15801
 mpoload 15802
 mpoload 15803
 mpoload 15804
 mpoload 15805
 drop all
endif
~
>hitprcnt_prog 5~
if quest (5,5,$n)==16
 emote gasps for air.
 say No, I am defeated.
 say Ssab will finally get his peace.
 say Some day I will return!
 say When I do, he will be a dead fish!
 shout I HATE YOU SSAB!
 emote falls to the ground, lifeless.
 mpecho The Hermit's body vanishes in a flash of red light.
 mpmset $n quest 5 5 17
 mppurge self
endif
~
|

@updated says to correct for spelling, grammar and add some flavor  12/18/03
#15801
duck ~
The duck~
A duck is here gracefully swimming around you.~
This duck seems happy, so don't ruin its attitude... it might get mean.
~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART
AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 
0 S
80 BODY_HEAD|BODY_WING BODY_WING 0d0+4200 0d0+60
100000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 80~
 mpechoat $n The duck quacks as you enter the room.
~
>speech_prog p Ssab sent me to act against the fishermen.~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==6
  if rand(4)
   say Good, good... I have been wanting to do this for a long time.
   say You may return to him with my help only if you help me first.
   say We ducks are sick of eating bread from the land-dwellers.
   say I would like to taste meat.  A store on shore sells chicken.
   say Please bring me some.
   mpmset $n quest 5 5 7
  endif
 endif
~
>speech_prog p The plan is canceled.~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==11
  say Why?
  say Did Ssab send this message?
  say He must have.
  emote ponders for a moment.
  say Hmm... It must be the hermit.
  say He is the only person strong enough to defeat Ssab.
  say Thank you for your help.
  say Tell Ssab the ducks agree.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 12
 endif  
~
>give_prog i15808~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==7
  say Hmm... this looks good.  You brought me what I wanted.
  emote takes a bite and concentrates on it for a minute.
  emote becomes disgusted and spits out the chicken.
  say Wow... I was expecting better.  That tasted very bad.
  say Oh well, a promise is a promise.
  say Go back to Ssab and tell him that we will join him.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 8
 endif
~
|
