>speech_prog p residence pass~
if quest (0,5,$n)==1
 say Yeah, I know something about them, I used to sell 
 say them to citizens in the area so they could live in
 say this fair city, but I no longer have any.  If you 
 say go around and find some citizens, they might have 
 say them, but will put up a fight in the process.
 mpmset $n quest 0 5 2
endif
~
>speech_prog p Who is the best fisherman?~
if quest (5,5,$n)==9
 say Why that is an easy question.
 say The best fisherman in town has to be the hermit.
 say He has to fish to keep himself fed.
 say Although, he has been suspected of stealing chickens.
 mpmset $n quest 5 5 10
endif
~
