>greet_prog 80~
if rand(20)
 say Hello, have you met our leader Ssab?
 say He is a very good and strong leader of the
 say fish of VanEttan Lake.
endif
 if quest (25,5,$n)==26
  emote peers at you intently, as if it has seen you somewhere before.
 endif
  if rand(70)
   if quest (25,5,$n)==26
    emote recognizes you as the slayer of it's leader!
    emote grows stronger from its rage!
    rescale self $n 115
    mpkill $n 
   endif
  endif
~
>death_prog 100~
 if quest (25,5,$n)==26
  emote sends out a cry of pain and realizes your strength.
  say You are very strong, please leave us alone.
  say We will no longer attack you if you do.
  emote tries to smile but dies in the act.
  mpmset $n quest 25 5 25
 endif
~
|
