>greet_prog 100~
 if quest (5,5,$n)<=6
   say Hello $n, how may I help you?
 endif
 if quest (5,5,$n)==18
   say We are forever grateful to you $n.
 endif
 if quest (5,5,$n)==17
  say I will be forever grateful to you!
  say You will be remembered by ducks and fish for eternity.
  say Here is your reward.
  mpoload 15821
  mpoload 15822
  mpoload 15823
  give i15821 $n
  give i15822 $n
  say And I found this in the water the other day... 
  say Thought you land-dwellers used it for something.
  give i15823 $n
  say May god bless your soul for the rest of eternity.
  say Thank you.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 18
 endif
~
>speech_prog leader~
 if quest (5,5,$n)<=6
  say Yes, I am the leader of this great lake.
  say How did you get here anyway?
  say I haven't seen a land-dweller in a long time.
  say Oh, I have a favor to ask you!
  emote pauses for a moment and ponders.
  say I need you to help me.
  say We must stop the fishermen from catching my subjects.
  say Can you help me?
 else
  say Yes, I am the leader of this great lake.
 endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
 if quest (5,5,$n)<=6
  gasp
  say GREAT! I believe one of the ducks can help me with this also.
  say Tell their leader I sent you to act against the fishermen.
  say Return with news of the ducks, I hope they will help me.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 6
  say Oh, and by the way, I can never tell out which duck is the leader.
  say You will have to talk to all of them.
  say Thank you very much.
 else 
  say yes what?
  emote ponders your thoughts.
 endif
~
>speech_prog p The ducks will join you.~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==8
  say Good, now we need to find the best fishermen in the area.
  say Ask some land-dwellers who the best fisherman is.
  say Maybe they will tell you.
  say When you know who it is tell me their name.
  say I will be waiting.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 9
 endif
~  
>speech_prog p The Hermit~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==10
  gasp
  say That is what I suspected.
  say He and I have been enemies for a very long time.
  say He used to be a duck a long time ago.
  say He attacked my subjects for their meat.
  say One day an illusionist saw these violent attacks.
  say The illusionist promised to help me, and he did.
  say He turned the hermit into a human so it would be harder
  say for him to come into the water and attack my kingdom.
  emote pauses for a second and cringes as he remembers the deaths.
  say I cannot defeat him.
  say The hermit, even though he is human, is still very strong,
  say maybe even stronger than when he was a duck.
  say Go tell the ducks that the plan is canceled.
  say There is nothing we can do but pray.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 11
 endif
~
>speech_prog p The ducks agree.~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==12
  say I figured they would.
  sigh
  say No one has ever been able to defeat the hermit.
  say Hmm... I haven't seen your power.
  say Do you think you can defeat him?
  say Let's find out, ready?
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 13
~
>speech_prog ready~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==13
  say Good, here goes nothing.
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 14
  mpkill $n
 endif
~
>fight_prog 5~
if quest (5,5,$n)==14
 emote glows a bright, bright blue and becomes surrounded by light.
 emote casts 'laehagem'.
 restore self
 say You are very good.
 say Would you be interested in trying to defeat the hermit?
 mpmset $n quest 5 5 15
 mpquiet on
 mpmload 15811
 mpquiet off
 mppurge self
endif
~
>speech_prog p I am interested.~
 if quest (5,5,$n)==15
  say Great!
  say I will reward you greatly when you have defeated him.
  say Thank you very much!
  mpmset $n quest 5 5 16
 endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
 if rand(75)
  emote radiates an evil glow that causes you to become very sick.
  mpquiet on
  c 'poison' $n
  c 'weaken' $n
  mpquiet off
 endif
  if rand(30)
   emote seems to glow a little and starts to feel better.
   mpquiet on
   c 'heal' 
   c 'heal'
   c 'heal'
   mpquiet off
  endif
   if rand(40)
    emote glows a burning red color and envelops you in underwater fire!
    c 'flamestrike' $n
    c 'fireball' $n
   endif
~
>death_prog 60~
 shout $n is a killer!
 shout Kill $n if you see them anywhere in this kingdom!
 mpmset $n quest 25 5 26
 say You shall die as an enemy of fish everywhere!
~
|

