pass residents~
The Resident's Pass~
Someone left a resident's pass on the ground here.~
This pass is used to identify residents of the VanEttan Lake community.
~
ITEM_TYPE_TREASURE
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE
0 0 0 0
1 15000 1
#15820
Ssab's armor~
Ssab's Armor~
A shiny piece of armor with Ssab engraved on it is here.~
This armor is very shiny, Ssab must have kept it clean.  It has a waxy,
glowing coating on the outside so that it doesn't corrode in water.
~
ITEM_TYPE_ARMOR
ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL|ITEM_FLAG_GLOW
ITEM_WEAR_BODY|ITEM_WEAR_TAKE
